<LanguageData>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] had a rare and happy childhood after being rescued by an anti-slavery organisation. During that time in the camp, [PAWN_pronoun] mastered many combat skills. After reaching adulthood, [PAWN_pronoun] devoted [PAWN_possessive] life to liberating more compatriots, eventually becoming a steadfast anti-slavery organisation fighter. -->
    <Mugirl_Adult.baseDesc>[PAWN_nameDef]因被反奴役组织解救而拥有了难得幸福的童年，在营地的那段时光里，她掌握了不少战斗技巧。成年之后，她将一生奉献于解放更多同胞，最终成为了一名坚定的反奴役组织战士。</Mugirl_Adult.baseDesc>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] had a rare and happy childhood after being rescued by an anti-slavery organisation. During that time in the camp, [PAWN_pronoun] mastered many combat skills. After reaching adulthood, [PAWN_pronoun] devoted [PAWN_possessive] life to liberating more compatriots, eventually becoming a steadfast anti-slavery organisation fighter. -->
    <Mugirl_Adult.description>[PAWN_nameDef]因被反奴役组织解救而拥有了难得幸福的童年，在营地的那段时光里，她掌握了不少战斗技巧。成年之后，她将一生奉献于解放更多同胞，最终成为了一名坚定的反奴役组织战士。</Mugirl_Adult.description>
    <!-- Mugirls' Liberator -->
    <Mugirl_Adult.title>雪牛娘解放者</Mugirl_Adult.title>
    <!-- Great Mugirl -->
    <Mugirl_Adult.titleShort>大雪牛娘</Mugirl_Adult.titleShort>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] endured immense hardship as a milking slave on a "cattle" farm, never qualifying to be treated as a human. Initially confined to narrow pens and exploited by the farm owner, [PAWN_pronoun] later transitioned from being a "dairy cow" to managing livestock for [PAWN_possessive] master when labour was short, operating machinery and processing fresh milk. However, [PAWN_pronoun] often struggled to handle the temperamental cattle and was frequently attacked by the herd. -->
    <Mugirl_CattleSlave.baseDesc>[PAWN_nameDef]作为养“牛”场的产奶奴隶历尽艰辛，始终未能获得成为“人”的资格。起初只是被关在狭窄的畜栏中受牧场主榨取，当人手不足时，她则从“奶牛”摇身一变成为协助主人管理牲畜的奴隶，操作机器并处理鲜奶。但她有时难以驾驭脾气古怪的牛群，屡屡受到攻击。</Mugirl_CattleSlave.baseDesc>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] endured immense hardship as a milking slave on a "cattle" farm, never qualifying to be treated as a human. Initially confined to narrow pens and exploited by the farm owner, [PAWN_pronoun] later transitioned from being a "dairy cow" to managing livestock for [PAWN_possessive] master when labour was short, operating machinery and processing fresh milk. However, [PAWN_pronoun] often struggled to handle the temperamental cattle and was frequently attacked by the herd. -->
    <Mugirl_CattleSlave.description>[PAWN_nameDef]作为养“牛”场的产奶奴隶历尽艰辛，始终未能获得成为“人”的资格。起初只是被关在狭窄的畜栏中受牧场主榨取，当人手不足时，她则从“奶牛”摇身一变成为协助主人管理牲畜的奴隶，操作机器并处理鲜奶。但她有时难以驾驭脾气古怪的牛群，屡屡受到攻击。</Mugirl_CattleSlave.description>
    <!-- Cattle Ranch Slave -->
    <Mugirl_CattleSlave.title>牛场奴隶</Mugirl_CattleSlave.title>
    <!-- Cattle Ranch Slave -->
    <Mugirl_CattleSlave.titleShort>牛场奴隶</Mugirl_CattleSlave.titleShort>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] was rescued by an anti-slavery organisation at a young age, allowing [PAWN_pronoun] to escape the same fate of enslavement as [PAWN_possessive] compatriots. [PAWN_pronoun] was placed in a camp hidden deep in the mountains, where [PAWN_pronoun] spent a happy childhood— for this race, such an experience was undoubtedly a luxury. -->
    <Mugirl_Child.baseDesc>[PAWN_nameDef]在年幼时便被某个反奴役组织解救，得以逃脱与同胞们相同的奴役命运。她被安置在隐匿于群山深处的营地中，度过了幸福的童年—————对这个种族而言，这样的经历无疑是一种奢望。</Mugirl_Child.baseDesc>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] was rescued by an anti-slavery organisation at a young age, allowing [PAWN_pronoun] to escape the same fate of enslavement as [PAWN_possessive] compatriots. [PAWN_pronoun] was placed in a camp hidden deep in the mountains, where [PAWN_pronoun] spent a happy childhood— for this race, such an experience was undoubtedly a luxury. -->
    <Mugirl_Child.description>[PAWN_nameDef]在年幼时便被某个反奴役组织解救，得以逃脱与同胞们相同的奴役命运。她被安置在隐匿于群山深处的营地中，度过了幸福的童年—————对这个种族而言，这样的经历无疑是一种奢望。</Mugirl_Child.description>
    <!-- The Rescued Mugirl -->
    <Mugirl_Child.title>被解救的雪牛娘</Mugirl_Child.title>
    <!-- Little Mugirl -->
    <Mugirl_Child.titleShort>小小雪牛娘</Mugirl_Child.titleShort>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] no longer remembers when [PAWN_pronoun] started engaging in heavy physical labour. As a child labourer, [PAWN_nameDef] served as cheap labour in factories or mines, sweating all day under harsh production conditions. To maximise the exploitation of [PAWN_nameDef]'s surplus value, [PAWN_pronoun] was forbidden from resting for more than ten minutes, let alone receiving basic cultural education. -->
    <Mugirl_ChildWorker.baseDesc>[PAWN_nameDef] 已不记得自己是什么时候开始参与繁重体力劳动的了。作为儿童劳工，[PAWN_nameDef]充当工厂或矿井当中的廉价劳动力，整日在恶劣的生产条件下挥洒汗水。为了最大限度地压榨 [PAWN_nameDef]的剩余价值，她被禁止休息十分钟以上，更不用说获得最基本的文化教育了。</Mugirl_ChildWorker.baseDesc>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] no longer remembers when [PAWN_pronoun] started engaging in heavy physical labour. As a child labourer, [PAWN_nameDef] served as cheap labour in factories or mines, sweating all day under harsh production conditions. To maximise the exploitation of [PAWN_nameDef]'s surplus value, [PAWN_pronoun] was forbidden from resting for more than ten minutes, let alone receiving basic cultural education. -->
    <Mugirl_ChildWorker.description>[PAWN_nameDef] 已不记得自己是什么时候开始参与繁重体力劳动的了。作为儿童劳工，[PAWN_nameDef]充当工厂或矿井当中的廉价劳动力，整日在恶劣的生产条件下挥洒汗水。为了最大限度地压榨 [PAWN_nameDef]的剩余价值，她被禁止休息十分钟以上，更不用说获得最基本的文化教育了。</Mugirl_ChildWorker.description>
    <!-- Child Labour -->
    <Mugirl_ChildWorker.title>儿童劳工</Mugirl_ChildWorker.title>
    <!-- Child Labour -->
    <Mugirl_ChildWorker.titleShort>童工</Mugirl_ChildWorker.titleShort>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] came of age in our colony. [PAWN_possessive] story continues. -->
    <Mugirl_Colonist.baseDesc>[PAWN_nameDef] 在我们的殖民地成年了。[PAWN_possessive] 的故事仍在继续。</Mugirl_Colonist.baseDesc>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] came of age in our colony. [PAWN_possessive] story continues. -->
    <Mugirl_Colonist.description>[PAWN_nameDef] 在我们的殖民地成年了。[PAWN_possessive] 的故事仍在继续。</Mugirl_Colonist.description>
    <!-- Mugirl Colonist -->
    <Mugirl_Colonist.title>雪牛娘殖民者</Mugirl_Colonist.title>
    <!-- Colonist -->
    <Mugirl_Colonist.titleShort>殖民者</Mugirl_Colonist.titleShort>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] is a fairly skilled construction labour. Starting with miscellaneous tasks on construction sites, [PAWN_nameDef] gradually accumulated various operational experiences, capable of taking on roles such as plumbing, bricklaying, and painting. [PAWN_nameDef] particularly enjoys the wonderful feeling of using a nail gun to shoot nails, that short and powerful gas ejection sound is especially pleasing to the ear. The immense physical exertion on the site led [PAWN_objective] to develop a habit of eating at a nearby small canteen, after all, who has the energy to cook for themselves after working non-stop? -->
    <Mugirl_ConstructionWorker.baseDesc>[PAWN_nameDef] 是一名水平不错的建筑工人。从工地上的杂活开始，[PAWN_nameDef]逐渐积累了各种操作经验，能胜任管道、泥瓦、粉刷等多种角色。[PAWN_nameDef]尤其喜爱使用射钉枪发射钉子的美妙感觉，那种短促有力的气体喷发声格外悦耳。工地上的巨大体能消耗令她养成了去附近小食堂吃饭的习惯，毕竟谁能在连轴转的工作后还有体力亲自下厨呢？</Mugirl_ConstructionWorker.baseDesc>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] is a fairly skilled construction labour. Starting with miscellaneous tasks on construction sites, [PAWN_nameDef] gradually accumulated various operational experiences, capable of taking on roles such as plumbing, bricklaying, and painting. [PAWN_nameDef] particularly enjoys the wonderful feeling of using a nail gun to shoot nails, that short and powerful gas ejection sound is especially pleasing to the ear. The immense physical exertion on the site led [PAWN_objective] to develop a habit of eating at a nearby small canteen, after all, who has the energy to cook for themselves after working non-stop? -->
    <Mugirl_ConstructionWorker.description>[PAWN_nameDef] 是一名水平不错的建筑工人。从工地上的杂活开始，[PAWN_nameDef]逐渐积累了各种操作经验，能胜任管道、泥瓦、粉刷等多种角色。[PAWN_nameDef]尤其喜爱使用射钉枪发射钉子的美妙感觉，那种短促有力的气体喷发声格外悦耳。工地上的巨大体能消耗令她养成了去附近小食堂吃饭的习惯，毕竟谁能在连轴转的工作后还有体力亲自下厨呢？</Mugirl_ConstructionWorker.description>
    <!-- Construction Site Labour -->
    <Mugirl_ConstructionWorker.title>工地劳工</Mugirl_ConstructionWorker.title>
    <!-- Construction Site Labour -->
    <Mugirl_ConstructionWorker.titleShort>工地劳工</Mugirl_ConstructionWorker.titleShort>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] grew up as an experiment subject in an agricultural research institute, undergoing many long-term medical observations and experiments, and became familiar with numerous medical terms. The managers told [PAWN_nameDef] that outside the institute, dangers lurked everywhere, and if [PAWN_pronoun] left, there was a risk of death at any time. During childhood, [PAWN_pronoun] never saw the true form of feed, nor did [PAWN_pronoun] ever see [PAWN_possessive] own kind. -->
    <Mugirl_ExperimentalChild.baseDesc>[PAWN_nameDef] 在某个农业研究所作为实验对象长大，接受了许多长期医疗观察和试验，对不少医学术语耳熟能详。管理者告诉[PAWN_nameDef]，研究所外面危机四伏，一旦离开随时有丧命的风险。在童年期间，[PAWN_pronoun] 从未见过饲料的原貌，也从未见过自己的同类。</Mugirl_ExperimentalChild.baseDesc>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] grew up as an experiment subject in an agricultural research institute, undergoing many long-term medical observations and experiments, and became familiar with numerous medical terms. The managers told [PAWN_nameDef] that outside the institute, dangers lurked everywhere, and if [PAWN_pronoun] left, there was a risk of death at any time. During childhood, [PAWN_pronoun] never saw the true form of feed, nor did [PAWN_pronoun] ever see [PAWN_possessive] own kind. -->
    <Mugirl_ExperimentalChild.description>[PAWN_nameDef] 在某个农业研究所作为实验对象长大，接受了许多长期医疗观察和试验，对不少医学术语耳熟能详。管理者告诉[PAWN_nameDef]，研究所外面危机四伏，一旦离开随时有丧命的风险。在童年期间，[PAWN_pronoun] 从未见过饲料的原貌，也从未见过自己的同类。</Mugirl_ExperimentalChild.description>
    <!-- Yield Enhancement Experiment Subject -->
    <Mugirl_ExperimentalChild.title>增产实验对象</Mugirl_ExperimentalChild.title>
    <!-- Yield Enhancement Experiment Subject -->
    <Mugirl_ExperimentalChild.titleShort>实验对象</Mugirl_ExperimentalChild.titleShort>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] spent years seeking livelihood opportunities among various assembly line factories in industrial parks, trying to create better living conditions with [PAWN_possessive] hands. If the fruits of [PAWN_possessive] labour were not legally unprotected, [PAWN_pronoun] might have continued working in the same sweatshop. [PAWN_nameDef] has worked in various jobs such as assembly, quality inspection, loading and unloading, and security, leaving sweat and toil in every position. Although forced by life circumstances to receive little education, [PAWN_pronoun] still harbours a longing for school. -->
    <Mugirl_FactoryWorker.baseDesc>[PAWN_nameDef]常年在工业园区的各大流水线工厂之间寻找谋生机会，试图用双手创造更好的生活条件。若不是劳动成果得不到法律保障，她也许还会在同一家血汗工厂继续工作。[PAWN_nameDef]干过装配、质检、装卸、安保等多种工作，每个岗位上都留下了辛劳汗水。尽管因生活所迫未能接受太多教育，她仍对校园心存向往。</Mugirl_FactoryWorker.baseDesc>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] spent years seeking livelihood opportunities among various assembly line factories in industrial parks, trying to create better living conditions with [PAWN_possessive] hands. If the fruits of [PAWN_possessive] labour were not legally unprotected, [PAWN_pronoun] might have continued working in the same sweatshop. [PAWN_nameDef] has worked in various jobs such as assembly, quality inspection, loading and unloading, and security, leaving sweat and toil in every position. Although forced by life circumstances to receive little education, [PAWN_pronoun] still harbours a longing for school. -->
    <Mugirl_FactoryWorker.description>[PAWN_nameDef]常年在工业园区的各大流水线工厂之间寻找谋生机会，试图用双手创造更好的生活条件。若不是劳动成果得不到法律保障，她也许还会在同一家血汗工厂继续工作。[PAWN_nameDef]干过装配、质检、装卸、安保等多种工作，每个岗位上都留下了辛劳汗水。尽管因生活所迫未能接受太多教育，她仍对校园心存向往。</Mugirl_FactoryWorker.description>
    <!-- Factory Worker -->
    <Mugirl_FactoryWorker.title>工厂劳工</Mugirl_FactoryWorker.title>
    <!-- Factory Worker -->
    <Mugirl_FactoryWorker.titleShort>工厂劳工</Mugirl_FactoryWorker.titleShort>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] has lived on a rural farm since [PAWN_possessive] earliest memories, driven by the owner to work diligently and without complaint. [PAWN_nameDef]'s childhood was spent tending crops and livestock, with blisters on [PAWN_possessive] hands always forming and breaking. For years, [PAWN_pronoun] only received the minimum amount of food on the farm. [PAWN_nameDef] does not know where this unpalatable paste comes from, because [PAWN_pronoun] has always been forbidden from entering the kitchen. -->
    <Mugirl_FarmSlave.baseDesc>[PAWN_nameDef] 从有记忆起就生存在一座乡村农场，受主人驱使而任劳任怨地工作。[PAWN_nameDef]的童年在照顾庄稼和牲畜当中度过，手上的水泡总是长了又破。多年来，她在农场只能得到最低限度的食物。[PAWN_nameDef] 不知道这些难以下咽的糊糊究竟从何而来，因为[PAWN_pronoun] 始终被禁止进入厨房。</Mugirl_FarmSlave.baseDesc>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] has lived on a rural farm since [PAWN_possessive] earliest memories, driven by the owner to work diligently and without complaint. [PAWN_nameDef]'s childhood was spent tending crops and livestock, with blisters on [PAWN_possessive] hands always forming and breaking. For years, [PAWN_pronoun] only received the minimum amount of food on the farm. [PAWN_nameDef] does not know where this unpalatable paste comes from, because [PAWN_pronoun] has always been forbidden from entering the kitchen. -->
    <Mugirl_FarmSlave.description>[PAWN_nameDef] 从有记忆起就生存在一座乡村农场，受主人驱使而任劳任怨地工作。[PAWN_nameDef]的童年在照顾庄稼和牲畜当中度过，手上的水泡总是长了又破。多年来，她在农场只能得到最低限度的食物。[PAWN_nameDef] 不知道这些难以下咽的糊糊究竟从何而来，因为[PAWN_pronoun] 始终被禁止进入厨房。</Mugirl_FarmSlave.description>
    <!-- Farm Slave -->
    <Mugirl_FarmSlave.title>农场奴隶</Mugirl_FarmSlave.title>
    <!-- Farm Slave -->
    <Mugirl_FarmSlave.titleShort>农场奴隶</Mugirl_FarmSlave.titleShort>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] has long been engaged in crop cultivation and livestock management on a large farm. [PAWN_nameDef] carries the scent of soil and hay, and the daily fieldwork has made [PAWN_objective] familiar with the growth cycles of various crops and animal habits. During the off-season, [PAWN_nameDef] often hears news about nearby farms from the farm owner. It is said that a cruel farm owner who keeps a large number of Mugirls often sends people to burn, kill, and rob everywhere, and [PAWN_pronoun] is glad that [PAWN_pronoun] does not have to take up arms to defend the farm. -->
    <Mugirl_FarmWorker.baseDesc>[PAWN_nameDef] 在大型农场长期从事作物种植和牲畜管理工作。[PAWN_nameDef]身上带着泥土与干草的香气，日复一日的田间劳作让她熟谙各类农作物的生长周期和动物习性。农闲时，[PAWN_nameDef]时常从农场主那里获悉附近农场的消息。据说有一个豢养大批雪牛娘的残忍农场主经常派人四处烧杀抢劫，她很庆幸自己不用拿起武器保卫农场。</Mugirl_FarmWorker.baseDesc>
