    <Mugirl_FarmWorker.description>[PAWN_nameDef] 在大型农场长期从事作物种植和牲畜管理工作。[PAWN_nameDef]身上带着泥土与干草的香气，日复一日的田间劳作让她熟谙各类农作物的生长周期和动物习性。农闲时，[PAWN_nameDef]时常从农场主那里获悉附近农场的消息。据说有一个豢养大批雪牛娘的残忍农场主经常派人四处烧杀抢劫，她很庆幸自己不用拿起武器保卫农场。</Mugirl_FarmWorker.description>
    <!-- Farm Labour -->
    <Mugirl_FarmWorker.title>农场劳工</Mugirl_FarmWorker.title>
    <!-- Farm Labour -->
    <Mugirl_FarmWorker.titleShort>农场劳工</Mugirl_FarmWorker.titleShort>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] embarked on a life of crime as an adult, living on the edge with street fights and gang brawls becoming daily occurrences. On the lawless fringes of society, [PAWN_pronoun] served local crime bosses, chasing dreams of getting rich overnight. Due to [PAWN_possessive] inexperience, [PAWN_pronoun] backed the wrong side in internal gang conflicts, became ostracized, and was forced into a life on the run, constantly moving to avoid detection. -->
    <Mugirl_GangMember.baseDesc>[PAWN_nameDef]成年后过上刀尖舔血的犯罪生涯，街头火并、聚众斗殴成日常。在缺乏治安的社会边缘，她为地头蛇效力，追逐一夜暴富梦想。因经验不足，帮派内斗中站队失误，被排挤，只能过上东躲西藏的逃亡生活。</Mugirl_GangMember.baseDesc>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] embarked on a life of crime as an adult, living on the edge with street fights and gang brawls becoming daily occurrences. On the lawless fringes of society, [PAWN_pronoun] served local crime bosses, chasing dreams of getting rich overnight. Due to [PAWN_possessive] inexperience, [PAWN_pronoun] backed the wrong side in internal gang conflicts, became ostracized, and was forced into a life on the run, constantly moving to avoid detection. -->
    <Mugirl_GangMember.description>[PAWN_nameDef]成年后过上刀尖舔血的犯罪生涯，街头火并、聚众斗殴成日常。在缺乏治安的社会边缘，她为地头蛇效力，追逐一夜暴富梦想。因经验不足，帮派内斗中站队失误，被排挤，只能过上东躲西藏的逃亡生活。</Mugirl_GangMember.description>
    <!-- Gang Member -->
    <Mugirl_GangMember.title>黑道成员</Mugirl_GangMember.title>
    <!-- Gang Member -->
    <Mugirl_GangMember.titleShort>黑道成员</Mugirl_GangMember.titleShort>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] is an experienced gladiator, making a living by participating in arena fights for substantial rewards. Through years of rigorous training in combat skills, [PAWN_pronoun] has mastered various weapons, hoping to prevail in the cruel and bloody contests of the arena. With limited medical facilities available, [PAWN_pronoun] had to learn folk remedies to treat injuries and illnesses. -->
    <Mugirl_Gladiator.baseDesc>[PAWN_nameDef]是经验丰富的角斗战士，以参加角斗赚取高额奖励维持生计。多年苦练格斗本领，掌握多种武器使用方式，希望在竞技场残酷血腥的角斗中胜出。医疗条件有限，她不得不学习土法偏方处理伤病。</Mugirl_Gladiator.baseDesc>
    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] is an experienced gladiator, making a living by participating in arena fights for substantial rewards. Through years of rigorous training in combat skills, [PAWN_pronoun] has mastered various weapons, hoping to prevail in the cruel and bloody contests of the arena. With limited medical facilities available, [PAWN_pronoun] had to learn folk remedies to treat injuries and illnesses. -->
    <Mugirl_Gladiator.description>[PAWN_nameDef]是经验丰富的角斗战士，以参加角斗赚取高额奖励维持生计。多年苦练格斗本领，掌握多种武器使用方式，希望在竞技场残酷血腥的角斗中胜出。医疗条件有限，她不得不学习土法偏方处理伤病。</Mugirl_Gladiator.description>
    <!-- Gladiator -->
    <Mugirl_Gladiator.title>角斗战士</Mugirl_Gladiator.title>
    <!-- Gladiator -->
