    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] served as a domestic servant in a wealthy household, mastering household service skills under the butler's strict training and being responsible for addressing all daily needs of the master's family. [PAWN_nameDef] undertook heavy household chores from a young age, yet lacked experience in pet care- after all, [PAWN_nameDef] had likely already occupied their ecological niche. -->
