    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] made a living running small goods retail, once prospering through business acumen and owning [PAWN_possessive] own shop. However, economic crisis, plague and warfare followed in quick succession. When [PAWN_pronoun] tried to defend [PAWN_possessive] business with weapons during several large-scale looting events, [PAWN_possessive] property was ultimately plundered by frenzied crowds. After regrouping, [PAWN_pronoun] mobilized all social connections to borrow funds and resumed [PAWN_possessive] life of hawking wares while travelling through streets and alleys. -->
    <Mugirl_Merchant.baseDesc>[PAWN_nameDef]靠经营小商品零售维持生计，凭借商业眼光一度发财，拥有自己的铺面。但经济危机、瘟疫与战乱接踵而至，她在几场大规模“零元购”中试图用武器保卫生意，财产最终仍被疯狂人群洗劫一空。重整旗鼓后，她动用所有社会关系筹借资金，再次开始游街串巷、吆喝叫卖的生活。</Mugirl_Merchant.baseDesc>
