    <!-- [PAWN_nameDef] secured work in an underground mine thanks to [PAWN_possessive] robust physique, barely scraping by on meager wages. In the pitch-black, dust-filled mine shafts, [PAWN_nameDef] swung picks and pushed mine carts day and night, meeting increasingly demanding quotas. With [PAWN_possessive] strained finances and virtually no leave, [PAWN_pronoun] avoided medical care, unwilling to undergo health checks that would disrupt [PAWN_possessive] work. -->
    <Mugirl_MineWorker.baseDesc>[PAWN_nameDef] 凭借过硬的体格找到了一份地下矿井的工作，依靠微薄的薪水艰难度日。在暗无天日、粉尘弥漫的矿道中，[PAWN_nameDef]整天整夜挥动镐头，推动矿车，完成越来越高的指标要求。捉襟见肘的钱包和几乎没有的休假，使她讳疾忌医，不愿接受体检而耽误工作。</Mugirl_MineWorker.baseDesc>
